{"id":"n2452ba16b4","headline":"Capital city home prices fall as experts predict Australia’s property slump could last a year and cut values by 10%","summary":"Buyers are abandoning auctions, and Sydney, Melbourne and Canberra median house prices ended May lower than at the end of 2025. Experts predict the slump could last a year and cut values by 10%.","why":"Residential property is a large share of Australian household wealth and bank lending, so a sustained price fall affects mortgage credit quality and construction activity.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Sydney","country":"Australia","lat":-33.869,"lon":151.209,"region":"oc"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"the Guardian","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jun/01/australia-home-prices-fall-year-long-decline-value-prediction"},"sources":[{"name":"the Guardian","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jun/01/australia-home-prices-fall-year-long-decline-value-prediction"}],"published_at":"2026-05-31T15:00:52Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"4bd0ee1209dd0cff","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-05-31T15:00:52Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-05-31T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/housing-construction-1407462.jpg","alt":"housing construction (illustration)","credit":"2211438","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/housebuilding-new-building-1407462/"}}